unteer treasurer]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135811918.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In a pivotal ruling, a Texas appeals court declared that the Lake Bonanza Property Owners Association bears no responsibility for a brawl involving its volunteer treasurer. This incident unfolded during a budget meeting where tensions escalated, leading to a physical confrontation between treasurer Courtney and a resident after the meeting was recorded. The court determined that Courtney acted outside his official capacity, resulting in a decision favoring the homeowners association.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-texas-homeowners-association-meeting-ended-in-a-physical-fight-between-a-resident-recording-the-proceedings-and-the-volunteer-treasurer-an-appeals-court-ruled-the-association-was-not-responsible-for-the-altercation/articleshow/135811918.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-texas-homeowners-association-meeting-ended-in-a-physical-fight-between-a-resident-recording-the-proceedings-and-the-volunteer-treasurer-an-appeals-court-ruled-the-association-was-not-responsible-for-the-altercation/articleshow/135811918.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-13T23:52:34+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135813970,imgsize-1768594.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Check their LinkedIn page': Senator John Kennedy on Jensen Huang's alleged Chinese spy affair; 'I know people have affairs']]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135812935.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/check-their-linkedin-page-senator-john-kennedy-on-jensen-huangs-alleged-chinese-spy-affair-i-know-people-have-affairs/articleshow/135812935.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/check-their-linkedin-page-senator-john-kennedy-on-jensen-huangs-alleged-chinese-spy-affair-i-know-people-have-affairs/articleshow/135812935.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-13T23:27:55+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Poulomi Ghosh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135813052,imgsize-40360.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Belgian workers found €240,000 gold pot, but court convicted all three of theft]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135798508.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/three-demolition-workers-found-a-hidden-pot-of-gold-coins-worth-240000-beneath-a-belgian-house-they-divided-and-sold-the-treasure-but-a-court-later-found-all-three-guilty-of-theft/articleshow/135798508.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/three-demolition-workers-found-a-hidden-pot-of-gold-coins-worth-240000-beneath-a-belgian-house-they-divided-and-sold-the-treasure-but-a-court-later-found-all-three-guilty-of-theft/articleshow/135798508.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-14T03:45:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135798765,imgsize-189053.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[British children's author investigated over grooming, assault allegations involving minors]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135812274.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/british-childrens-author-david-walliams-investigated-over-grooming-assault-allegations-involving-minors/articleshow/135812274.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/british-childrens-author-david-walliams-investigated-over-grooming-assault-allegations-involving-minors/articleshow/135812274.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-13T23:09:14+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Prisha Patnaik</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135812324,imgsize-58616.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Ohio Appeals Court revives inmate's challenge to foreclosure over improper service claims]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135773509.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A foreclosure dispute surrounding Mamadou Diallo is back in court due to notification concerns. The Ohio appeals court has ruled that Diallo's subsequent actions do not establish proof of proper service for the foreclosure notice. Having been convicted for the murder of his spouse, Diallo contested the foreclosure judgment on the grounds of claimed service deficiencies.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/an-ohio-bank-foreclosed-on-a-home-while-its-owner-was-in-prison-for-murdering-his-wife-after-the-property-sold-with-61060-left-over-a-november-10-appeals-court-revived-his-challenge-over-how-the-papers-were-served/articleshow/135773509.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/an-ohio-bank-foreclosed-on-a-home-while-its-owner-was-in-prison-for-murdering-his-wife-after-the-property-sold-with-61060-left-over-a-november-10-appeals-court-revived-his-challenge-over-how-the-papers-were-served/articleshow/135773509.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-14T03:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135773585,imgsize-726259.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Teens raised by strict, obey-without-question parents tend to hold more antisocial beliefs, a US study found, and they also showed small rises in anxiety and depression]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135805627.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Authoritarian parenting can lead to persistent antisocial thoughts among teenagers, affecting their social behavior and emotional well-being. Research indicates that strict parenting fosters beliefs that may justify rule-breaking and aggression. While not all adolescents display increased anxiety or depression, some experience heightened symptoms over time. These findings suggest that parenting styles significantly impact adolescent development and understanding of social norms.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/teens-raised-by-strict-obey-without-question-parents-tend-to-hold-more-antisocial-beliefs-a-us-study-found-and-they-also-showed-small-rises-in-anxiety-and-depression/articleshow/135805627.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/teens-raised-by-strict-obey-without-question-parents-tend-to-hold-more-antisocial-beliefs-a-us-study-found-and-they-also-showed-small-rises-in-anxiety-and-depression/articleshow/135805627.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-14T02:55:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Lifestyle Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135806176,imgsize-82202.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Kylie Jenner faces fourth staff lawsuit in seven months over housekeeper claims]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135795873.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/kylie-jenner-faces-fourth-household-staff-lawsuit-in-seven-months-as-former-housekeeper-alleges-dog-bite-pepper-spray-injury-unpaid-overtime-and-being-trapped-in-a-closet/articleshow/135795873.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/kylie-jenner-faces-fourth-household-staff-lawsuit-in-seven-months-as-former-housekeeper-alleges-dog-bite-pepper-spray-injury-unpaid-overtime-and-being-trapped-in-a-closet/articleshow/135795873.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-14T02:50:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135796013,imgsize-613267.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Mike Tyson buys $13 million Florida mansion with 80-foot pool and bass pond]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135794091.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/in-2025-mike-tyson-bought-a-13-million-florida-mansion-spanning-12286-sq-ft-the-lakefront-estate-has-an-80-foot-pool-a-gym-and-a-private-bass-pond/articleshow/135794091.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/real-estate/news/in-2025-mike-tyson-bought-a-13-million-florida-mansion-spanning-12286-sq-ft-the-lakefront-estate-has-an-80-foot-pool-a-gym-and-a-private-bass-pond/articleshow/135794091.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-14T02:45:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Lifestyle Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135794208,imgsize-817956.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Missouri appeals court rules couple no longer owned Lexus after tow-truck driver took wrecked car and title]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135774432.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[A recent ruling from a Missouri appeals court determined that a couple abandoned ownership of their damaged Lexus by signing the title over to an unidentified tow-truck driver. The court upheld that the towing company’s claim of an improperly processed title transfer made the couple responsible for associated towing fees. This case serves as a critical reminder of the complexities surrounding title transfers and their legal repercussions in vehicle ownership.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-missouri-couple-gave-their-wrecked-lexus-and-signed-title-to-an-unidentified-tow-truck-driver-in-2018-years-later-it-resurfaced-with-a-6450-towing-bill-but-an-appeals-court-ruled-they-no-longer-owned-the-car/articleshow/135774432.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/a-missouri-couple-gave-their-wrecked-lexus-and-signed-title-to-an-unidentified-tow-truck-driver-in-2018-years-later-it-resurfaced-with-a-6450-towing-bill-but-an-appeals-court-ruled-they-no-longer-owned-the-car/articleshow/135774432.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-14T02:00:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135774630,imgsize-148775.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Most people dislike coffee at first and learn to love it, and scientists now say the reason may be a slow dopamine signal from the gut that teaches the brain to like flavours linked with calories, even bitter ones]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135805699.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[Researchers have discovered that our tastes for certain foods, even those that might initially be bitter, shift as we grow. The gut sends vital signals to our brain about what we eat, influencing our cravings through dopamine, which is known for its role in reward and motivation. Consequently, this insight provides a fascinating explanation for why we often learn to appreciate flavors such as coffee.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/discovery/most-people-dislike-coffee-at-first-and-learn-to-love-it-and-scientists-now-say-the-reason-may-be-a-slow-dopamine-signal-from-the-gut-that-teaches-the-brain-to-like-flavours-linked-with-calories-even-bitter-ones/articleshow/135805699.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/science/discovery/most-people-dislike-coffee-at-first-and-learn-to-love-it-and-scientists-now-say-the-reason-may-be-a-slow-dopamine-signal-from-the-gut-that-teaches-the-brain-to-like-flavours-linked-with-calories-even-bitter-ones/articleshow/135805699.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-11-14T01:55:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Lifestyle Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135806815,imgsize-1897911.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Taylor Swift and Travis Kelce's no-gift wedding gesture benefits animal rescue]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135790749.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/taylor-swift-and-travis-kelces-no-gift-wedding-request-revealed-as-west-virginia-animal-rescue-group-thanks-two-guests-for-a-donation-months-after-the-couples-reported-26-million-charity-contributions/articleshow/135790749.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/taylor-swift-and-travis-kelces-no-gift-wedding-request-revealed-as-west